{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "891803f5f7adc05c",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "天城理人音樂會現場",
   "x": 308,
   "y": 223,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 1792
  },
  {
   "id": "15b656be28fbb5d6",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "廢棄孤兒院",
   "x": 1288,
   "y": 46,
   "width": 4008,
   "height": 632
  },
  {
   "id": "9590a700eb3a40e9",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Hangman 謎題",
   "x": 1312,
   "y": 223,
   "width": 308,
   "height": 108
  },
  {
   "id": "b503d9bb1f55ecce",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "地下室",
   "x": 1644,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 2656,
   "height": 525
  },
  {
   "id": "83a056d93f512c5f",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "沙羅",
   "x": 1668,
   "y": 223,
   "width": 308,
   "height": 395
  },
  {
   "id": "6eca50fefd90742f",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "第一張門票",
   "x": 2000,
   "y": 199,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 156
  },
  {
   "id": "a19268416bb74cc2",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "第二封信件",
   "x": 2664,
   "y": 187,
   "width": 1304,
   "height": 431
  },
  {
   "id": "54446d7342cadeac",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "尼歌娜",
   "x": 4324,
   "y": 187,
   "width": 308,
   "height": 467
  },
  {
   "id": "d9162b012ce923e5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "塞雷亞清楚人魚公主行蹤",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1605,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "fe6cadab6973e968",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**達姬與尼歌娜大致理解其他王國狀況**\n\n達姬與尼歌娜都大致理解其他王國的狀況",
   "x": 5344,
   "y": 207,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 148,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "07347c080b654fd3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**尼歌娜管束公主達姬鼓勵享受**\n\n尼歌姬會管束公主，達姬則鼓勵公主享受",
   "x": 5676,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "35b723befabebd4d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**尼歌娜達姬角色與身份閱歷不符**\n\n尼歌娜和達姬的角色與各自的身份閱歷不符，達姬理應比尼歌娜更清楚犯錯的後果以及帶來的外交問題",
   "x": 5676,
   "y": 482,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 172,
   "color": "#DC2626"
  },
  {
   "id": "8d6f560b41cd2b70",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**其他王國十分重視規矩犯規嚴懲**\n\n其他王國十分重視規矩，犯規會被嚴懲",
   "x": 6008,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "2d27b3acf0b12b1b",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**水妖掌握行蹤且不在公主忙碌時出現**\n\n水妖對人魚公主的行蹤有一定掌握，且從來不會在人魚公主忙碌時出現",
   "x": 6340,
   "y": 195,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 172,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "344392e3466c06f1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "有人密切監視人魚公主動向",
   "x": 6340,
   "y": 542,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "ac24682bfdd0a2b9",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "多人監視人魚公主",
   "x": 996,
   "y": 255,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "00350ca7861456cc",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "保守派監視者",
   "x": 996,
   "y": 542,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#16A34A"
  },
  {
   "id": "74f8cf022f82482d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "改革派與保守派矛盾",
   "x": 996,
   "y": 769,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "0b7495ea598e752a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**彭達拉薩人存在敏感會激化矛盾**\n\n彭達拉薩人的存在十分敏感，會激化人魚內部矛盾",
   "x": 996,
   "y": 936,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "4ffe86ff21227538",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "就算不至內戰也會瓦解同盟",
   "x": 664,
   "y": 1223,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "7e620ed765426ebf",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**塞雷亞明知而同意合作並淡化問題**\n\n塞雷亞明知而同意合作，且刻意淡化問題",
   "x": 996,
   "y": 1175,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 148,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "3dffff398c39b824",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "塞雷亞向VPTS洩密",
   "x": 498,
   "y": 1772,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "61ca95860e34ef71",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "與北太平洋立場矛盾",
   "x": 996,
   "y": 1438,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "f0f3db644ebfa861",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "塞雷亞與長老目標不同",
   "x": 664,
   "y": 1605,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "26a4bb2e830d24f6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "北太平洋有意挑起爭端",
   "x": 996,
   "y": 1605,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "1c187786bbb46b68",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "不利米迦勒復興海之住民",
   "x": 332,
   "y": 1438,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "4dfec7118bf3606a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "復興不是米迦勒的真正目的",
   "x": 332,
   "y": 1605,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "2d247acea143c5ef",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "長老向VPTS洩密",
   "x": 996,
   "y": 1772,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "cbde140d3079a65c",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "有利米迦勒綁架人魚公主",
   "x": 664,
   "y": 1438,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "0413deaf6fbf9f68",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "挑起內部爭端",
   "x": 498,
   "y": 1939,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "73d129c535141005",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**選擇孤兒院暗指公主形同孤兒**\n\n選擇孤兒院的理由：暗指人魚公主沒有父母，形同孤兒",
   "x": 4680,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "13ef9e5252749c4f",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**二十九年前火災三人倖存**\n\n29年前發生火災，案件紀錄3人倖存",
   "x": 5012,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "e650b9db679a14d1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "場景含意",
   "x": 1336,
   "y": 255,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "c6d3c5b3197cd22d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**地下室有APCS未能提前發現沙羅**\n\n地下室有APCS，導致未能提前發現沙羅",
   "x": 4016,
   "y": 207,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 148,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "3ac26482a529bb25",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "手套",
   "x": 4016,
   "y": 542,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#16A34A"
  },
  {
   "id": "cb82b33feec3a657",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "V前往海都城帶走沙羅",
   "x": 1692,
   "y": 255,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "3bff1fbdd6b2e883",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "V知道海都城位置",
   "x": 1692,
   "y": 542,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "2522a8ef4d3e9eb5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**座標海拔**\n\n座標、海拔",
   "x": 2024,
   "y": 231,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "3e48fbf60bd225cf",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "時間",
   "x": 2356,
   "y": 255,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "3d6b964239b127bc",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "以阿奎斯托語寫成",
   "x": 2688,
   "y": 255,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "8e07270ef4b19a02",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "V懂得阿奎斯托語",
   "x": 2688,
   "y": 542,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "d2fcd87e61d787f9",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "V知道沙羅是前公主",
   "x": 3020,
   "y": 542,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "a6a24df9c26e75af",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "對象為前公主",
   "x": 3020,
   "y": 255,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "24702162b0a436d4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**地址行李保險箱編號密碼**\n\n地址、行李保險箱編號、密碼",
   "x": 3352,
   "y": 231,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "0bfa515370eff1ab",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**四月六日至七日領取時限**\n\n4月6日0時0分後至4月7日0時0分前領取",
   "x": 3684,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "10fed45a21ac0061",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**基層卻知道監視者存在**\n\n明明只是基層，卻知道監視者的存在",
   "x": 4348,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "45a6866e952852a7",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**暗中保護公主防保守派抓把柄**\n\n暗中保護公主，並防止保守派抓到把柄",
   "x": 4348,
   "y": 506,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  }
 ],
